sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Consumer as Consumer
    participant Service as UserService
    participant Users as UsersClient
    participant UsersAPI as Identity Users API
    participant Names as NamesClient
    participant NamesAPI as Identity Names API
    Note over UsersAPI,NamesAPI: Two APIs of the same external Identity system
    Consumer->>+Service: UserName(42) - unchanged
    Service->>+Users: GetUser(42)
    Users->>+UsersAPI: Call user endpoint through configured protocol/policies
    UsersAPI-->>-Users: Wire response
    Users-->>-Service: UserDto(nameId=17, surname=Lee)
    Service->>+Names: GetName(17)
    Names->>+NamesAPI: Call name endpoint through configured protocol/policies
    NamesAPI-->>-Names: Wire response
    Names-->>-Service: NameDto(givenName=Ann)
    Note over Service: Construct Domain Model through public domain APIs
    Service-->>-Consumer: Domain name Ann Lee - unchanged
